Classic Slots
Classic slot machines, as the name suggests, are the original and oldest mechanical slot machines. It is a 3-reel slot with simple gameplay. They are also known as three-reel slots, as they involve spinning the reels and matching the symbols on the top, middle, and bottom reels to win. Classic slots have a simple design, mainly featuring symbols such as fruits, vegetables, bars, etc. This slot game is famous among players for its simplicity. 

Overview and Characteristics of Classic Slot Machines (3-Reels, Basic Symbols)
The best slot games for beginners is this three-reel slot game has three vertical symbols that spin when the player presses the ‘spin’ button. The reels stop playing and show the three symbols which determine the paylines. These three symbols have to be matched for the player to win. The symbols mainly include fruits, bars, bells, or sevens. The basic characteristics of these types of slot games include: Simple slot gameplay, basic slots symbols, three-reel payout system, higher volatility rate.


Progressive Jackpot Slots
As the name suggests, progressive jackpot slots are known for their larger payouts. Progressive slots are one of the most popular forms of slots that are played globally and offer bigger payouts. The concept of the progressive jackpot is simple. Each time a player makes a bet, a portion of the bet, usually 1% or 2% of the wager amount, is added to the contribution. As more players play, the chances of winning increase until someone wins the progressive jackpot. The winning of a progressive jackpot slot game also depends on whether the player lands on a big bonus or succeeds in making a specific combination of symbols. 


