High Volatility vs. Low Volatility Types of Slot Games
A slot machine volatility level is directly related to the payout structure. It indicates a payout structure that reflects how frequently a slot machine can pay. It is one of the most vital pieces of information about a slot machine as it directly reflects the payout of the game. High volatility slots offer larger payouts but in less number of times whereas low volatility slots give lower payouts in more number times. This is an inbuilt system of a slot machine but doesn’t actually impact the payout. 


Penny Slots
One of the most common types of slot games is penny slots. Penny slot games are played for a very small amount which can be one cent for a single spin. These penny slots are an old concept used in many casinos till now. Now you can play one spin for around 20-50 cents. Penney slot machines are found in busy areas other than casinos which include airports. 


Cluster Pay Outs
Cluster pay slots are unique yet interesting slot games that are played online to eliminate traditional paylines and have a cluster pay mechanism. The main criteria for winning a cluster payout is to form matching symbols in a minimum number of rounds. The symbols formed could be horizontal or vertical and should come a minimum number of times for the player to secure a win. 
